<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>宝宝体质特点&奶粉选购</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #3b82c4;
            font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .main-title {
            color: white;
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .section-box {
            background-color: #f4f8fc;
            border: 3px solid #8bb8e8;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 35px 20px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .section-title {
            position: absolute;
            top: -22px;
            left: 20px;
            background-color: #3b82c4;
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            border: 3px solid white;
        }
        .star-icon {
            font-size: 20px;
        }
        .features-grid {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .feature-item {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            width: 24%;
        }
        .feature-img-placeholder {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            padding: 5px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .feature-text {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #333;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .tips-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .tip-item {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .tip-subtitle {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: white;
            -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px #3b82c4;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .tip-desc {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .highlight {
            color: #3b82c4;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="main-title">宝宝体质特点&奶粉选购</div>

        <div class="section-box">
            <div class="section-title">
                <span class="star-icon">⭐</span> 新生儿宝宝的体质有哪些特点？
            </div>
            <div class="features-grid">
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-img-placeholder placeholder">[Illustration: Baby holding stomach]</div>
                    <div class="feature-text">肚肚脆弱</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-img-placeholder placeholder">[Illustration: Intestines]</div>
                    <div class="feature-text">吸收差</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-img-placeholder placeholder">[Illustration: Crying baby]</div>
                    <div class="feature-text">体质差</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-img-placeholder placeholder">[Illustration: Baby with rash]</div>
                    <div class="feature-text">体质敏感</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-box">
            <div class="section-title">
                <span class="star-icon">⭐</span> 选择奶粉的时候要选哪种？
            </div>
            <div class="tips-list">
                <div class="tip-item">
                    <div class="tip-subtitle">1.奶源纯净安全的</div>
                    <div class="tip-desc">建议<span class="highlight">优选有机</span>的奶源，从牧场到加工都满足有机生产的要求，从源头更安全。</div>
                </div>
                <div class="tip-item">
                    <div class="tip-subtitle">2.低敏不刺激的</div>
                    <div class="tip-desc">新生宝宝的肚肚娇弱，选择<span class="highlight">A2蛋白</span>的A2奶源更亲和宝宝小肚肚，不会刺激小肚肚从而引起肚肚不适。</div>
                </div>
                <div class="tip-item">
                    <div class="tip-subtitle">3.好消化吸收的</div>
                    <div class="tip-desc">看奶粉的成分中是否包含助力宝宝吸收的<span class="highlight">益生菌和益生元</span>成分，这些都是可以帮助宝宝更好吸收营养的。</div>
                </div>
                <div class="tip-item">
                    <div class="tip-subtitle">4.味道清淡，口感蓬松细腻的</div>
                    <div class="tip-desc">新生宝宝更适合口味清淡的奶粉哦~</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
